2 CONC ritage Family Trees] via wife [http://www.geni.com/profile-34667032880 Eleonora 7. Principe Di Francavilla (born Borghese)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 28 2014, 23:03:32 UTC''
