2 CONT * '''Prosper-Louis d'Arenberg duc of Aerschot''' [Parents] was born on 28 Apr 1785 in Enghien. He died on 27 Feb 1861 in Bruxelles. He married '''Ludmilla Lobkowicz Princess of Lobkowicz''' on 26 Jan 1819 in Horzin.
