2 CONT F, #98986, b. 10 November 1830, d. 2 October 1913
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=16 Jun 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie Prinzessin von Lobkowicz was born on 10 November 1830 at Billin. She was the daughter of Joseph Prinz von Lobkowicz and Franziska Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid. She died on 2 October 1913 at age 82 at St. Florian.
