1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert Pachta z Rájova
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert was born on April 28th, 1817 in Jablonné v P..  Robert's father was František Josef Pachta z Rájova and his mother was Helena Haugvitz, von.  His paternal grandfather is Jáchym Josef Pachta z Rájova. He had three brothers a
2 CONC nd six sisters, named František Josef, Eugen Václav, Gotthard, Johanna, Aloisie, Vilemina, Mathilda, Helena and Bertha.  He was the seventh oldest of the ten children.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at the age of 78 on May 7th, 1895 in Engelszell.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source / Forrás:
