1 NAME Albert György Gyula Mária /Apponyi/
2 GIVN Albert György Gyula Mária
2 SURN Apponyi
2 _MARNM Apponyi de Nagyappony
2 NICK Georg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 MAY 1846
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vienna
3 STAE Vienna
3 CTRY Austria
