2 CONT * Johannes Maria Aloys Otto Heinrich Alexander Prinz von Schönburg-Hartenstein M, #91157, b. 12 September 1864, d. 30 March 1937, Johannes Maria Aloys Otto Heinrich Alexander Prinz von Schönburg-Hartenstein was born on 12 Septembe
2 CONC r 1864 at Enzesfeld. He was the son of Alexander Prinz von Schönburg-Hartenstein and Karoline Josephine Prinzessin von und zu Liechtenstein. 
2 CONT * He married Sophie Prinzessin zu Oettingen-Oettingen und Oettingen-Wallerstein, daughter of Karl Friedrich Prinz zu Oettingen-Oettingen und Oettingen-Wallerstein and Ernestine Gräfin Czernin von und zu Chudenitz, on 27 April 1897
2 CONC . He died on 30 March 1937 at age 72 at Vienna, Austria.
2 CONT * Children of Johannes Maria Aloys Otto Heinrich Alexander Prinz von Schönburg-Hartenstein and Sophie Prinzessin zu Oettingen-Oettingen und Oettingen-Wallerstein
