0 @N6000000002322315614@ NOTE Throughout their stormy marriage, Francis Joseph, profoundly influenced by
1 CONT his wife Elizabeth, remained deeply attached to her. Although a gentleman of
1 CONT irresistible charm, he was greatly feared as the head of his house. He was
1 CONT profoundly saddened by her assassination and by his son's earlier suicide in
1 CONT 1889. Yet, Francis Joseph, who became lonelier as time went on, could be a
1 CONT generous amd amiable father to his daughters and those members of the house
1 CONT who bowed to him.
